  "guideTitle": "How it works",
  "disclaimer": "Customs vary. For practical questions, ask your rav.",
  "onbWelcomeBody": "Read the parsha twice and the Targum once — one aliyah a day, done before Shabbat.",
  "onbStart": "Start this week's parsha",
  "onbLocationTitle": "Where will you be this Shabbat?",
  "onbMethodTitle": "How do you read?",
  "onbPlanTitle": "Your weekly plan",
  "onbHonor": "Shnayim Mikra runs on the honor system. Log what you read, wherever you read it — a Chumash in shul counts just as much as this app.",
  "onbChangeAnytime": "You can change this anytime in Settings.",
